<title>USA: 3Com Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>3Com Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>SANTA CLARA, Calif., March 20 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.47		    $0.42</p>
<p> Net		 87,645		   74,590</p>
<p> Revs		786,778		  606,002</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary187,215		  177,378</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.54		    $0.84</p>
<p> Net		 284,786		  148,356</p>
<p> Revs		2,317,214		1,666,835</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary185,442		  175,843</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the most recent nine month period included a charge of about $6.6 million for costs associated with the acquisition of OnStream Networks. Excluding this charge, proforma net income was $291.4 million or $1.57 per share.  </p>
<p>Net income for the year-ago nine months included a charge of about $69 million for merger costs associated with the acquisition of Chipcom Corp. Excluding this charge, proforma net income was $197.6 million on a pretax basis, or $1.12 per share.</p>
<p>Latest third quarter net income compares with First Call consensus estimate of $0.46 per share.</p>
</text>
